[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0168","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1889","title":"Microsoft XML Core Services 未初始化内存远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft XML Core Services（MSXML）3.0、4.0、5.0 和 6.0 版本中存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。当 MSXML 解析特制 XML 内容时，由于未正确初始化内存对象，攻击者可通过构造恶意网站诱导用户访问，触发内存破坏，从而实现远程代码执行或拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或浏览网页），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS12-043 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1889"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-13T04:46:46Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:29Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-043 提供的更新，该更新修复了 MSXML 3.0/4.0/5.0/6.0 中的未初始化内存访问漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或手动下载 KB2721691（MSXML 3.0）、KB2721693（MSXML 4.0）、KB2721692（MSXML 5.0）、KB2721694（MSXML 6.0）对应版本补丁。临时缓解措施：将 Internet 安全区域设置为高以禁用 ActiveX 控件，或配置 IE 在运行 ActiveX 控件前提示。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2719615","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-174A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-192A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-043","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15195","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1889","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19186","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1889.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2012/CVE-2012-1889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1889","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2012/CVE-2012-1889.rules","https://github.com/buffer/thug/blob/c6776b2b9d44228772c76cc8b82218a395c764ad/thug/ActiveX/modules/MSXML2DOMDocument.py","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2012/README.md","https://github.com/sergey-pronin/OSCP_Source/blob/c3121bae586e23bce13e16a4091302d298833df2/Exploit_Code/CVE-2012-1889.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1889/README_KO.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1889.txt","https://github.com/whu-enjoy/CVE-2012-1889","https://github.com/l-iberty/cve-2012-1889"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0245","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2040","title":"Adobe Flash Player 不可信搜索路径漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 安装程序存在不可信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426，又称二进制植入/DLL 预加载攻击）。当用户在 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Android 等平台安装或更新 Flash Player 时，安装程序会在当前目录及其他可写目录中搜索可执行文件，攻击者可预先在这些目录中放置特制的恶意程序（木马可执行文件），使安装程序在搜索路径时优先加载并执行该恶意文件，从而以当前用户权限获取系统控制权，实现权限提升或代码执行。该漏洞影响 Flash Player 10.3.183.20 及 11.x 之前的所有版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 之前的版本，覆盖桌面端和移动端多个操作系统平台。CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，攻击条件为攻击者需在目标系统拥有可写目录的访问权限，可通过社会工程诱导用户下载并运行包含恶意可执行文件的安装包或指向恶意目录的快捷方式触发漏洞利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2040"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 10.3.183.20（Windows/Mac/Linux）、11.3.300.257（Windows/Mac）、11.2.202.236（Linux）、11.1.111.10（Android 2.x/3.x）或 11.1.115.9（Android 4.x）；同时将 Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610。如无法立即升级，请仅从 Adobe 官方渠道下载安装程序，并避免从网络共享目录或临时目录运行 Flash Player 安装程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2040","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2040","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2040.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2040","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2040","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2040","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2040.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2012/CVE-2012-2040.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2040"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0244","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2039","title":"Adobe Flash Player 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 及 Adobe AIR 存在空指针引用漏洞（CWE-476）。攻击者可通过向受影响版本（Windows/Mac 上 Flash Player 低于 10.3.183.20 或 11.x 低于 11.3.300.257，Linux 上低于 10.3.183.20 或 11.x 低于 11.2.202.236，Android 2.x/3.x 上低于 11.1.111.10，Android 4.x 上低于 11.1.115.9，以及 Adobe AIR 低于 3.3.0.3610）的用户发送特制的恶意 Flash 内容，触发空指针解引用，导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件进行利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2039"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Flash Player 至以下安全版本：Windows/Mac 升级至 10.3.183.20 或 11.3.300.257，Linux 升级至 10.3.183.20 或 11.2.202.236，Android 2.x/3.x 升级至 11.1.111.10，Android 4.x 升级至 11.1.115.9，Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，改用 HTML5 替代方案以永久消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2039","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2039","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2039.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2039","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2039","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2012/CVE-2012-2039.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2039.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2039","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2039"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0243","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2038","title":"Adobe Flash Player 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在访问限制绕过漏洞（CWE-200），攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页等方式，利用未指定的向量绕过 Flash Player 的安全访问控制机制，从而获取本不应被访问的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux 及 Android 等多个平台的 Flash Player 版本（10.3.183.20 之前及 11.x 系列）以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户交互配合。Adobe 已在安全公告 APSB12-14 中发布修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2038"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.20 或 11.3.300.257（Windows/Mac）、11.2.202.236（Linux）、11.1.111.10（Android 2.x/3.x）、11.1.115.9（Android 4.x），升级 Adobe AIR 至 3.3.0.3610。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或启用 click-to-play 机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2038.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2038","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2038","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2038.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2038","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2038","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2012/CVE-2012-2038.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2038.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2038","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2038"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0242","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2037","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 及 Adobe AIR 存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119）。由于 Flash Player 在处理特定媒体内容时对内存边界检查不充分，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开特制文件触发内存破坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.20 之前版本、11.x 系列特定版本以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开文件），CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2037"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 10.3.183.20 或 11.3.300.257（Windows/Mac）、11.2.202.236（Linux）、11.1.111.10（Android 2.x/3.x）、11.1.115.9（Android 4.x），并将 Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或使用 Chrome 内置的 PPAPI Flash 沙箱缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2034.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2037.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2037","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2037","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2037.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2037","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2037","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2012/CVE-2012-2037.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2037.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2037"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0241","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2036","title":"Adobe Flash Player 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意内容诱导用户访问，触发内存整数溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows/Mac OS X/Linux/Android 及 Adobe AIR 等多个平台的 Flash Player 版本（Windows/Mac 上低于 10.3.183.20 和 11.3.300.257，Linux 上低于 10.3.183.20 和 11.2.202.236，Android 2.x/3.x 上低于 11.1.111.10，Android 4.x 上低于 11.1.115.9，以及 Adobe AIR 低于 3.3.0.3610），CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证，通过诱导用户打开恶意网页或文件即可触发漏洞，实现完全控制目标系统。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2036"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.20（Windows/Mac）或 11.3.300.257（Windows/Mac 11.x）、11.2.202.236（Linux 11.x），Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610。鉴于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2036","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2036","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2036.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2036","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2036","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2012/CVE-2012-2036.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2036","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2036.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2036"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0240","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2035","title":"Adobe Flash Player 栈溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787）。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页或打开包含恶意 Flash 内容的文件，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.20 之前版本及 11.x 系列特定版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 之前版本。CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开文件）。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2035"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.20 及以上（Windows/Mac/Linux）或 11.3.300.257 及以上（Windows/Mac 11.x）、11.2.202.236 及以上（Linux 11.x）；Android 升级至 11.1.111.10（2.x/3.x）或 11.1.115.9（4.x）；Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610 及以上。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或使用 Chrome 内置 Flash 沙箱隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2035","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2035","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2035.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2035","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2035","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2012/CVE-2012-2035.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2012/CVE-2012-2035","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2035.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2035"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0198","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2034","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Adobe Flash Player 存在内存破坏漏洞，影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux 及 Android 平台上的 10.3.183.20 及更早版本、11.x 系列 11.3.300.257 及更早版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 及更早版本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过未知攻击向量向目标系统发送特制内容触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏，进而执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用需要用户交互（例如诱使用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文档），成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2034"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 10.3.183.20 或更高版本（Windows/Mac OS X/Linux），Android 2.x/3.x 升级至 11.1.111.10 及以上、Android 4.x 升级至 11.1.115.9 及以上；将 Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级，请在浏览器设置中禁用 Flash Player 插件，或通过组策略限制 Flash 内容的运行，避免访问不受信任的网站和打开未知来源的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2034.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2012/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-2034.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2034"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0066","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0507","title":"Oracle Java SE AtomicReferenceArray 类型违规远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE i18n子组件中AtomicReferenceArray类实现存在类型违规漏洞，未验证数组是否为Object[]类型，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意Java应用程序或Applet，利用类型混淆绕过Java沙箱安全限制，实现沙箱逃逸并执行任意代码，或导致JVM崩溃造成拒绝服务。影响Oracle Java SE 7 Update 2及更早版本、6 Update 30及更早版本、5.0 Update 33及更早版本。攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络诱导用户访问包含恶意Java Applet的网页即可触发，无需用户交互，CVSS 3.1评分9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互、影响机密性/完整性/可用性均为高。该漏洞已被纳入CISA已知被利用漏洞目录，Metasploit框架集成了AtomicReferenceArray Type Violation利用模块（ExploitDB编号18679），攻击者可构造恶意Applet绕过安全管理器直接执行系统命令。Oracle已在2012年2月CPU补丁中修复该漏洞，建议升级至Java SE 7 Update 3、6 Update 31或5.0 Update 34及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0507"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-07T22:55:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:26Z","remediation":"安装 Oracle Java SE 7 Update 4 或更高版本、Java SE 6 Update 32 或更高版本、或 Java SE 5.0 Update 34 或更高版本，并确保启动时禁用不安全的 i18n 子组件，同时在 Java Control Panel 中启用自动安全更新并使用最新的安全策略设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/mmpc/archive/2012/03/20/an-interesting-case-of-jre-sandbox-breach-cve-2012-0507.aspx","http://krebsonsecurity.com/2012/03/new-java-attack-rolled-into-exploit-packs/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00009.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00010.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133364885411663&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133365109612558&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133847939902305&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254866602253&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254957702612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0508.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0514.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1455.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48589","http://secunia.com/advisories/48692","http://secunia.com/advisories/48915","http://secunia.com/advisories/48948","http://secunia.com/advisories/48950","http://weblog.ikvm.net/PermaLink.aspx?guid=cd48169a-9405-4f63-9087-798c4a1866d3","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2420","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpufeb2012-366318.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52161","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=788994","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-0507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18679","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-0507.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/0b3544b982e9e72f18783404822d75ab7ead4564/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2012-0507.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0507.json","https:/