Thunderbird 的内容安全策略（CSP）实现未能正确拦截内联事件处理程序，导致安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 文档，利用该漏洞绕过 CSP 的内联脚本拦截机制，更容易实施跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 12.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 之前版本、Thunderbird 5.0 至 12.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.10 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1944"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:37Z","remediation":"升级至 Firefox 13、Firefox ESR 10.0.5、Thunderbird 13、Thunderbird ESR 10.0.5 或 SeaMonkey 2.10 及以上版本。各 Linux 发行版用户可通过系统包管理器安装对应安全更新（如 Ubuntu USN-1463-1、Red Hat RHSA-2012:0710/0715）。如无法立即升级，建议在 Web 应用中部署额外 XSS 过滤机制作为补充，不单独依赖 CSP 内联脚本拦截策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0710.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0715.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49981","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:088","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-36.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=751422","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17005","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1944.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1944.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1944.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1944.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1944","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1944","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1944.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1944","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/da5ad7125749ac49ac2c49c4f3cd740b81c2c723/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1944","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1944.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0205.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0204","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0204.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1943","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey Windows Updater服务DLL劫持本地特权提升漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 12.0、Thunderbird 12.0 及 SeaMonkey 2.9 的 Windows 版更新服务程序 Updater.exe 存在不可信搜索路径漏洞。本地攻击者可将恶意构造的 wsock32.dll 文件放置于应用程序目录中，当 Updater.exe 加载该动态链接库时，恶意代码将以系统服务权限执行，导致本地权限提升。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度中等，但成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1943"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 14.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 14.0 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.11 及以上版本，或升级至 Firefox ESR 10.0.6 / Thunderbird ESR 10.0.6。无法立即升级时，移除应用程序目录中非预期的 wsock32.dll 文件，并限制应用程序目录的写入权限为仅管理员可写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-35.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=750850","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16924","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1943.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1943.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1943.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1943.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1943","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1943.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1943.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1943.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-1943.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-1943.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0203","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1942","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey Windows Updater DLL加载本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 12.0、Thunderbird 12.0 及 SeaMonkey 2.9 的 Windows 版更新程序（Mozilla Updater）和 Windows Updater Service 存在任意 DLL 加载漏洞。本地攻击者可通过将恶意 DLL 放置在更新程序搜索路径的特定目录中，诱使更新服务以高权限加载该 DLL，从而获取 SYSTEM 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，成功后可完全控制受影响系统。Mozilla 已在 Firefox 13.0、Thunderbird 13.0 及 SeaMonkey 2.10 中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1942"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-06-05T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 13.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 13.0 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.10 及以上版本，或升级 Firefox/Thunderbird ESR 至 10.0.5。该漏洞源于 Mozilla Updater 和 Windows Updater Service 在加载 DLL 时未验证路径安全性，本地用户可通过将恶意 DLL 放置在特定目录（如应用程序安装目录）实现提权。如无法立即升级，可通过配置 Windows 软件限制策略（Software Restriction Policies）禁止非标准路径下的 DLL 加载，或使用 AppLocker 规则限制 updater.exe 仅从受信任路径加载模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00012.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-35.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2013/mfsa2013-45.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=748764","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16951","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1942.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1942.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1942.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1942.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1942","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1942.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1942.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1942.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-1942.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-1942.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0203.toml"}]